The audio decoder in this crate (src/audio.rs, src/audio_tables.rs) is a
port to Rust of the audio decoder of PL_MPEG (see LICENSE-pl_mpeg), which
is based on kjmp2 by Martin J. Fiedler (http://keyj.emphy.de/kjmp2/). It is
an altered version, not the original software: restructured, and with the
requantisation of the samples done as the standard gives it (see the
notes at the top of src/audio.rs). kjmp2's source carries this notice:

